E003, plan step C1: taskcore's pick windows (--pick-windows on; taskcore/README.md, "Pick windows"). Branch picks from ksr 04a3f70.
Laptop, 2026-11-01; nice 10; one thread per search and per taskcore run, 3 per reading; load 10 to 29 from other jobs. Seed 1.
Fast Downward rev 7ea2755 (third_party/downward, release build). A* is astar(landmark_cost_partitioning(lm_rhw())); search memory
limit 3 GB; a guard stops a search when the machine has under 3 GB available (it fired once, below). Time limits are Fast Downward's
--search-time-limit, in CPU seconds. "lb" is the last f-layer A* reached: every plan costs at least that much.
